    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suspicious Cat]",
      "translation" : "[可疑的貓]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 66,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I can't believe a mummy could do this to me. Oh man, it hurts. Nobody should find out about this....",
      "translation" : "真不敢相信木乃伊竟然會這樣對我。好痛啊！可不能讓別人知道這件事..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 68,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Mummy? What happened?",
      "translation" : "木乃伊？發生了什麼？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 68,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Pretend not to know anything.",
      "translation" : "假裝什麼都不知道。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 70,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suspicious Cat]",
      "translation" : "[可疑的貓]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 71,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You caught me! Darn it...I didn't expect my reputation as a tomb raider would get damaged like this...",
      "translation" : "被你發現了！可惡...我沒想到自己盜墓賊的名聲會變成這樣..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 73,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suspicious Cat]",
      "translation" : "[可疑的貓]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 74,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "But come on, they're so strange! They're mummies! Just mummies, you know? They shouldn't be that strong!",
      "translation" : "可是你想想，它們可是木乃伊！只是木乃伊而已，怎麼會那麼強！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 76,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Strong mummies? Where are they?",
      "translation" : "強大的木乃伊？它們在哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 76,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "End the conversation.",
      "translation" : "結束對話。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 77,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suspicious Cat]",
      "translation" : "[可疑的貓]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 78,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Whaaat~ you don't want to hear my story? Fine! You'd better not mention my name anywhere else!",
      "translation" : "什麼～你不想聽我的故事？好吧！你最好別把我的名字告訴別人！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 81,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suspicious Cat]",
      "translation" : "[可疑的貓]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 82,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Haha, it's a secret.",
      "translation" : "哈哈，這是秘密。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 83,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I found out while I was stealing... No, I mean, just walking through the pyramid.",
      "translation" : "我偷東西的時候發現的...不，我是說，我只是路過金字塔時發現的。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 85,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suspicious Cat]",
      "translation" : "[可疑的貓]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 86,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "When I saw a mummy coming toward me, I was like 'whatever' and didn't care. But then he knocked me down with a slap in the face! How could he do that to a cute cat like me! You bandaged freak... you just wait and see!",
      "translation" : "我看到木乃伊朝我走來時，心想“隨便啦”，根本沒放在心上。結果它一巴掌就把我打倒了！它怎麼能這樣對一隻可愛的貓！你這個繃帶怪...走著瞧！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 88,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I would like to go, too.",
      "translation" : "我也想去。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 88,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "End the conversation.",
      "translation" : "結束對話。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 90,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suspicious Cat]",
      "translation" : "[可疑的貓]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 91,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "No way! I spent so much time finding that path!!",
      "translation" : "才不行！我花了那麼多時間才找到那條路！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 93,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suspicious Cat]",
      "translation" : "[可疑的貓]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 94,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hmm... but if you insist, just give me 5000 Zeny. I'll lead you.",
      "translation" : "嗯...不過你要是堅持，就給我5000 Zeny，我帶你去。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 95,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "What~? Don't give me that look! Do you have any idea how hard it is for a cat to survive in Midgard!",
      "translation" : "什麼～？別那樣看我！你知道一隻貓在米德加爾特生存有多難嗎！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 97,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suspicious Cat]",
      "translation" : "[可疑的貓]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 98,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^FF0000But come to think of it, a weakling like you won't survive there. Maybe for a second if you're lucky?^000000",
      "translation" : "^FF0000不過話說回來，你這麼弱，去了那裡也活不了。運氣好的話，或許還能撐一會兒？^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 99,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Well, it's none of my business. But I warned you anyway!",
      "translation" : "算了，這不關我的事。不過我還是提醒過你了！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 101,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Pay 5,000 zeny and set out.",
      "translation" : "支付5000 Zeny，出發。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 101,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Forget it.",
      "translation" : "算了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 104,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suspicious Cat]",
      "translation" : "[可疑的貓]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 105,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Where do you think you're going! You're so broke!",
      "translation" : "你想去哪兒！你窮得叮噹響！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 109,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suspicious Cat]",
      "translation" : "[可疑的貓]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 110,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Bah, what's up with this old money... you don't have anything sparkly or shiny?!",
      "translation" : "呸，這些舊錢算什麼...你沒有閃閃發亮的東西嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 111,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ahh, just follow me!",
      "translation" : "啊，跟我來就好！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 116,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suspicious Cat]",
      "translation" : "[可疑的貓]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 117,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Gosh, you don't even have 5000 Zeny, do you?",
      "translation" : "天啊，你連5000 Zeny都沒有嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 123,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suspicious Cat]",
      "translation" : "[可疑的貓]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 124,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "That stupid mummy slapped me again while you were looking away! Sniff sniff... Let's go back, meow!",
      "translation" : "我剛才沒注意的時候，那隻笨木乃伊又打了我一巴掌！嗚嗚...我們回去吧，喵！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 126,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Go back to Thief Guild",
      "translation" : "返回盜賊公會"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 126,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Eliminate Verit",
      "translation" : "消滅維瑞特"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 126,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Eliminate Ancient Mummy",
      "translation" : "消滅古代木乃伊"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 126,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It's nothing",
      "translation" : "沒什麼"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 128,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suspicious Cat]",
      "translation" : "[可疑的貓]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 129,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Right right... let's go back.",
      "translation" : "好吧好吧...我們回去吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 136,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suspicious Cat]",
      "translation" : "[可疑的貓]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 137,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Look at that Verit, he's afraid of us! Kyaahaha! We're safe, at least for a while!",
      "translation" : "看那隻維瑞特，它怕我們呢！呀哈哈哈！至少暫時安全了！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 143,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suspicious Cat]",
      "translation" : "[可疑的貓]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 144,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Did you know that cats and dogs don't get along?",
      "translation" : "你知道貓和狗不合嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 146,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suspicious Cat]",
      "translation" : "[可疑的貓]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 147,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Look at that ugly and hideous Verit. He's scowling, wagging his tail and trying to come closer.",
      "translation" : "看那隻又醜又嚇人的維瑞特。它皺著眉、搖著尾巴，還想靠近我們。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 148,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Oh, you don't have a tail, right? He thinks I'm a thorn in his side, and he's trying to start a fight now!",
      "translation" : "哦，你沒有尾巴吧？它覺得我礙眼，現在還想找我打架！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 150,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suspicious Cat]",
      "translation" : "[可疑的貓]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 151,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Look at him, so greedy and drooly... I don't like the way he breathes, either. I can't stand how he's making those gobbling sounds...",
      "translation" : "看它那副貪婪又流口水的樣子...我也不喜歡它呼吸的樣子，受不了它吧唧吧唧地嚼東西..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 152,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It's so obvious that he's waiting to attack me from behind.",
      "translation" : "它肯定在等機會從背後偷襲我，這也太明顯了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 154,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suspicious Cat]",
      "translation" : "[可疑的貓]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 155,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Gosh, I could have scratched his face so hard if it wasn't for my stomachache!",
      "translation" : "要不是我肚子疼，我早就把它的臉抓花了！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 156,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hey, it's not because I'm afraid of Majoruros!",
      "translation" : "喂，我才不是怕米諾陶！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 158,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suspicious Cat]",
      "translation" : "[可疑的貓]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 159,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "If you want to go home, you'd better beat up that ugly doggie! Otherwise, he'll bite you!",
      "translation" : "想回家的話，就把那隻醜狗打倒！不然它會咬你的！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 161,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Help him",
      "translation" : "幫幫它"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 161,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Stay away",
      "translation" : "離遠點"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 163,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suspicious Cat]",
      "translation" : "[可疑的貓]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 164,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Good, the target number is 20! Good luck!",
      "translation" : "好，目標數量是20只！祝你好運！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 168,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suspicious Cat]",
      "translation" : "[可疑的貓]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 169,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Pah! You don't care about me? Fine, you traitor!",
      "translation" : "呸，你一點都不關心我？好吧，你這個叛徒！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 173,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suspicious Cat]",
      "translation" : "[可疑的貓]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 174,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Is Verit's training going well?",
      "translation" : "維瑞特訓練得怎麼樣了？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 176,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Sure.",
      "translation" : "沒問題。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 176,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I want to stop.",
      "translation" : "我想停下。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
